1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:10,300
We've arranged a priority review for the Reed family's request and are contacting their treatment provider today.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,300
They're calling it approved.

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,400
Payment isn't approved. Take 'approved' out of our caption.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,140
Can we say the family can book treatment?

5
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:29,570
Not until payment's approved. Use the review date.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,300
They approved it. Can we have Thursday back?

7
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:46,300
It says review, Mara. I still need them to authorize payment.

8
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,900
I shared that headline.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,920
I swapped my shift. I told her we were coming.

10
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:59,140
Keep the shift for now. Let me call billing again.

11
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:02,970
Please don't tell me it's sorted until it is.

12
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:17,200
We reopened this two days before the shooting. Here.

13
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,800
You called me on my break.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,800
But my story got them to move faster.

15
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:31,900
Yes. We'd already started.

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,800
I saved you the window seat.

17
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,900
Okay. Give me a minute.

18
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:53,700
Thursday's yours till noon tomorrow. Call that number. I'll send them my note.

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,300
Noon. Okay.

20
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,300
Will the clinic have it today?

21
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:09,300
This covers the current treatment. We send it once you've signed.

22
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:19,700
Once this claim's settled, no more interviews about it.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,200
I take the money and stop talking. That's the deal?

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,960
And if I don't sign?

25
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:32,400
The claim stays disputed. You can keep appealing.

26
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,800
Then put the next round in here.

27
00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:44,400
I can't promise they'll approve the next one.

28
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,700
I'm taking this to my lawyer. Don't call the store.

29
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,300
Have him call me.

30
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,300
We can call it an update.

31
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:07,800
We got it wrong. Put a correction on the original.

32
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,800
Pull it, and we lose that slot.

33
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,400
Pull it.

34
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,570
And the original story?

35
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:26,790
The treatment headline was wrong. I'm still chasing the records.

36
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:35,800
What's next? Pick one thing.

37
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:38,400
The doctors' access records.

38
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,300
All of these. Not just Ellie.

39
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:49,400
Pick one. What's the last page you got?

40
00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:56,700
This one. Nothing after that.

41
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:03,600
This notice came later. Did you ask them for an update?

42
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:10,310
They send another letter. Then another. People run out of time.

43
00:04:10,610 --> 00:04:13,750
Did you ask this family what happened next?

44
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:16,010
They'd already been turned down.

45
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:19,060
I can see that. Did you ask?

46
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:32,200
No. I thought I knew what the answer would be.

47
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:34,800
Put the date here.

48
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Do we have to put that in?

49
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:42,400
Yes. I need it all.

50
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,140
It makes it sound like I didn't care.

51
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:54,750
Then tell me what you did. Don't fix how it sounds.

52
00:04:55,050 --> 00:04:58,190
I stopped asking. I kept the first answer.

53
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,300
Get the later pages.
